    [5799] = {
        achievementId = 5799,
        name = "Only the Penitent...",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Only the Penitent...",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Precise orb interactions and kneeling matter; a helper makes the timing much easier.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Precise orb interactions and kneeling matter; a helper makes the timing much easier.\n\n1. Enter Firelands and clear through Baleroc to cross the bridge toward Staghelm. STOP before killing the three Druids of the Flame at his arena. The central humanoid must remain alive casting Kneel to the Flame, and both large flame orbs must still be present.\n\n2. Dismiss combat pets, minions and temporary companions, remove summon procs and leave shapeshift forms for a straightforward attempt. Bind /kneel or /sit. Move toward an orb only between casts, then kneel BEFORE each cast finishes. A hit can remove the orbs and fail the attempt.\n\n3. With two players, send one to each orb and stand very close inside the orange floor swirls. After a flame cast finishes, activate both orbs together. Briefly stand if the channel does not register while kneeling, remain close for activation and kneel again before the next cast. The old six-player requirement is obsolete.\n\n4. For a practiced solo route, activate the first orb immediately after a cast, cross quickly with available movement abilities, activate the second and kneel again. Recent mage comments use Alter Time and Shimmer for the crossing and return. Watch the actual orb animation; seeing a channel from too far away does not prove activation.\n\n5. If the orbs disappear without credit, leave Staghelm alive. Use the bridge portal back to the entrance, leave and reset eligible trash before retrying, respecting entry limits. Check both orbs have returned before another attempt. Only after the achievement appears should you clear the druids and kill Staghelm.",
