    [5828] = {
        achievementId = 5828,
        name = "Glory of the Firelands Raider",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Glory of the Firelands Raider",
        description = "A guaranteed Firelands achievement mount. Six Heroic boss kills, Shannox's tour and the flame-orb coordination are the main objectives.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Several bosses must survive setup mechanics, and Only the Penitent needs precise coordinated interactions or a practiced solo movement route.\n\n1. Track Glory of the Firelands Raider (5828), set legacy Raid Difficulty to Heroic, and enter Firelands at Mount Hyjal 47.2,78.1. Bring a helper for the two flame orbs if possible and convert the group to a raid. Remove automatic damage, reflective effects and pets before the Shannox route and other setup fights.\n\n2. Clear a safe circuit through the Molten Fields without killing Shannox when the trash threshold spawns him. Bucket List requires HIM to enter five named areas while alive. Keep the achievement tracked. At high level, kill Rageface alone if his stun prevents movement, leaving Shannox and Riplimb alive; avoid cleave hitting the boss.\n\n3. Pull Shannox and lead him through Flamebreach (34.1,75.1), Beth'tilac's Lair (29.1,62.3), Path of Corruption (34.0,30.8), Shatterstone (61.2,45.4) and The Ridge of Ancient Flame (61.6,55.9). These pins are route markers: move far enough for Shannox himself to cross each area boundary and check its criterion. The wall below Beth'tilac's upper room counts without climbing to her. Kill Shannox only after all five locations are registered.\n\n4. Beth'tilac - Death from Above: kill a hanging Spinner and use its web strand to reach the upper canopy. Damage Beth'tilac there and follow her down if she transitions. Do not kill any Cinderweb Drone on the ground: use single-target attacks on the boss and leave drones alive. If deliberately killing a drone, wait until it climbs up after losing energy and kill it on the web. Finish Beth'tilac for the Heroic kill and the challenge.\n\n5. Lord Rhyolith - Not an Ambi-Turner: attack only his RIGHT foot to steer him clockwise. Do not attack the left foot and make him turn left. Once his armor breaks and his body becomes attackable, kill him. At high level this can be a very short right-foot phase.\n\n6. Alysrazor - Do a Barrel Roll!: avoid Brushfire, Lava Spew, Incendiary Cloud and Fiery Tornado throughout the encounter. Kill the flame druids before Brushfire casts, stay away from the worms' fire cones and attack Alysrazor as soon as she is properly engaged. A fast high-level kill before the tornado phase is simplest. Anyone flying with feathers must avoid the clouds as well as the ground team's hazards.\n\n7. Baleroc - Share the Pain: kill him promptly before anyone suffers Torment more than three times. If the fight lasts, rotate crystal soakers and keep Tormented players apart to avoid spreading the effect. Complete Baleroc's Heroic kill and cross the newly accessible bridge toward Staghelm.\n\n8. STOP before Staghelm's arena for Only the Penitent. Leave the central humanoid Druid of the Flame alive while it casts Kneel to the Flame. Dismiss pets and temporary minions, leave shapeshift forms and remove summon/damage procs. Put /kneel or /sit on a convenient key. The two large Fandral's Flame orbs stand on opposite sides of the arena.\n\n9. Advance only between casts, then kneel BEFORE each cast finishes. Get one player to each orb and stand inside its close orange floor swirl. After a cast finishes, briefly stand if necessary to make the interaction register, and activate both orbs together. Remain close through the short activation and kneel again before the next cast. Being hit by the flame makes the orbs disappear and fails the attempt.\n\n10. If solo, use a class with rapid movement between the orbs: activate the first just after a flame cast, cross immediately, activate the second and kneel again. Mage comments describe Alter Time plus Shimmer to return to the first orb. This is timing-sensitive; a helper is simpler. If either orb disappears, use the bridge portal back to the entrance, leave, reset the uncompleted trash and re-enter. Leave Staghelm alive while retrying, and respect the instance-entry limit.\n\n11. Once Only the Penitent has actually appeared, clear the flame druids and defeat Majordomo Fandral Staghelm on Heroic. The six required Heroic kills are Shannox, Beth'tilac, Rhyolith, Alysrazor, Baleroc and Staghelm; Ragnaros is optional and can be farmed for Pureblood Fire Hawk afterward.\n\n12. Review all twelve criteria in 5828. A missed boss challenge may be completed on an eligible Normal run or another character, while the six Heroic kill criteria still require Heroic. After the meta completes, check the Mount Journal and reward mail for Corrupted Fire Hawk and learn the mount.",
        stepCount = 12,
        waypoints = {
            {
