        difficultyReason = "Bring the living Shannox himself across five area boundaries in one engagement.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Bring the living Shannox himself across five area boundaries in one engagement.\n\n1. Enter Firelands and clear a safe circuit through the Molten Fields until Shannox spawns. Remove passive damage and cleaving pets. Start him without damaging him; kill Rageface separately if his stun prevents the tour, while preserving Shannox.\n\n2. Lead Shannox through Flamebreach 34.1,75.1; Beth'tilac's Lair boundary 29.1,62.3; Path of Corruption 34.0,30.8; Shatterstone 61.2,45.4; and Ridge of Ancient Flame 61.6,55.9. Follow the marked circuit and allow the boss to catch up at every destination.\n\n3. Credit depends on SHANNOX crossing each boundary, not just your minimap displaying the subzone name. The low cliff beside Beth'tilac's lair can count without climbing into her upper room. Watch the five criteria and move farther into an area if one is still missing.\n\n4. After all five areas are covered during this engagement, kill Shannox. Keep him alive if tracking is delayed and recheck the route; do not discard a valid attempt merely because an external tracker flags killing his dogs as a failure.",
