    [5845] = {
        achievementId = 5845,
        name = "A Bunch of Lunch",
        category = "Professions",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "A Bunch of Lunch",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Complete the three city daily checklists for your faction across repeated resets.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Complete the three city daily checklists for your faction across repeated resets.\n\n1. Track A Bunch of Lunch and its CURRENT city checklist. Alliance uses Stormwind, Ironforge and Darnassus; Horde uses Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff and Undercity. Learn basic Cooking and enable Trivial Quests.\n\n2. Each day, inspect the three city givers before accepting a Cooking daily. Choose a quest whose name is still missing for its city's five-quest achievement. Accepting one hides the other cities' offers, and completing one spends the shared capital daily slot for this profession.\n\n3. Complete that quest's local objectives and turn it in to its giver. Repeat after resets, moving between cities as their missing variants appear. Finish all five variants for each of the three cities; fifteen completions of one city's repeat cannot replace the other cities.\n\n4. Use Zidormi in Darkshore for accessible old Darnassus or Zidormi in Tirisfal for old Undercity when necessary. A destroyed present-day city is not a reason to abandon these still-usable timelines.\n\n5. When all three city sub-achievements are complete, check this meta. Account progress can display other characters' criteria, but each character still has its own daily lockout. The Cooking and Fishing slots are separate, so work on both professions together if useful.",
