    [5855] = {
        achievementId = 5855,
        name = "Ragnar-O's",
        category = "Raids",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Ragnar-O's",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Stop Ragnaros in the meteor phase and ignite three meteors before ending the fight.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Stop Ragnaros in the meteor phase and ignite three meteors before ending the fight.\n\n1. Enter Firelands on 10-player Normal for a simple dedicated attempt and clear to Ragnaros. Disable passive damage and pets that retaliate. Use controlled damage, a lower-level helper or Whole-Body Shrinka' before combat if your normal attack would kill him.\n\n2. Bring Ragnaros to around 30% while keeping him ABOVE 10%, then stop attacking. Wait for at least THREE Living Meteors to spawn. Keep an eligible target in melee range so he continues the encounter normally; a passive pet can help, but avoid pets with automatic damaging effects.\n\n3. Kite the meteors near the middle of the platform. When Sulfuras Smash creates Lava Waves, lead or knock the meteors through the waves. Target each meteor and confirm its Lavalogged debuff; the visual appearance alone is not sufficient.\n\n4. Once THREE meteors are actually Lavalogged, finish Ragnaros promptly. Do not kill the boss before the setup, and do not trust an early failed message from a tracker that confuses the intermission elementals with meteors. On Heroic, the subsequent final phase can complicate keeping the ignition condition, which is why Normal is the recommended dedicated route.",
