    [5860] = {
        achievementId = 5860,
        name = "The 'Unbeatable?' Pterodactyl: BEATEN.",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "The 'Unbeatable?' Pterodactyl: BEATEN.",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Ten completions of a daily vehicle quest after its introductory chain.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Ten completions of a daily vehicle quest after its introductory chain.\n\n1. Finish Mount Hyjal's Shrine of Aviana and Hatchery storyline, including the jousting introduction and Egg Wave. Use the blue portal around 39,58 to enter the hatchery; walk through it. The daily marker may be invisible from outside.\n\n2. Inside, accept Vigilance on Wings from Farden Talonshrike. Mount the provided jousting bird, use its flap action to maintain height, and fly into the marked enemy birds/eggs required by today's quest. Follow the vehicle objectives rather than trying to use ordinary mounted combat.\n\n3. Return to Farden and TURN IN the daily. Repeat after daily resets until the achievement records TEN completions. Finishing the original Egg Wave quest once awards the separate introductory achievement, not ten daily completions.\n\n4. Check the reward mail for the other jouster pet. If the mailed pet duplicates the one already learned, later Retail comments report the missing color available from a stable master after this achievement. Check the journal before buying or deleting anything.",
