    [5864] = {
        achievementId = 5864,
        name = "Gang War",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Gang War",
        difficulty = "medium",
        difficultyReason = "Needs a second player and the correct quest and outdoor phase.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Needs a second player and the correct quest and outdoor phase.\n\n1. Finish Mount Hyjal through Aessina's Miracle, then begin the Sanctuary of Malorne's Regrowth/Molten Front introduction. Enable Trivial Quests. Complete The Sanctuary Must Not Fall, collect 20 Marks of the World Tree for Calling for Reinforcements, and follow Through the Gates of Hell into the Molten Front. The portal is at 27.6,56.3 in Hyjal.\n\n2. Accept The Protectors of Hyjal and keep it in your log. Bring another player to Sethria's Roost with the same War Mode/Chromie Time settings and compatible Hyjal phase. The opponent does not need the daily.\n\n3. Start a duel within Sethria's Roost and win it. An opponent can voluntarily type /forfeit after the duel begins. Swap wins if both players need the achievement; a normal world-PvP kill is not a duel victory.\n\n4. If the players disappear in different phases, first align their campaign progress. Later comments also report starting at the edge around 36,74 where both players are visible, then stepping into Sethria's Roost for the finish. Verify that the duel remains active; phasing can cancel it. Check credit before turning in the daily.",
