        name = "Have... Have We Met?",
        category = "Quests",
        sourceType = "Achievement",
        source = "Have... Have We Met?",
        difficulty = "hard",
        difficultyReason = "Six random visiting helpers, including an opposite-faction-only spawn.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Six random visiting helpers, including an opposite-faction-only spawn.\n\n1. Finish Mount Hyjal through Aessina's Miracle, then begin the Sanctuary of Malorne's Regrowth/Molten Front introduction. Enable Trivial Quests. Complete The Sanctuary Must Not Fall, collect 20 Marks of the World Tree for Calling for Reinforcements, and follow Through the Gates of Hell into the Molten Front. The portal is at 27.6,56.3 in Hyjal.\n\n2. Accept The Protectors of Hyjal, go to Sethria's Roost and inspect the helpers that arrive. Target each needed named visitor and use /wave: Linken, Hemet Nesingwary, Nat Pagle, Mankrik, Chromie and Thassarian. Waving at their ordinary versions elsewhere in Azeroth does not count.\n\n3. Mankrik is summoned for HORDE questers; Thassarian for ALLIANCE questers. You can wave at another player's helper. Arrange a visit with the other faction or use eligible characters on both factions for their shared achievement criteria.\n\n4. For the remaining visitors, check new daily groups and other players' helpers in the Roost. Four ordinary protectors can be a valid day's result. Repeatedly abandoning the daily does not guarantee new named helpers, and there is no fixed completion schedule.\n\n5. The numbered comment offers a meeting method when a known opposite-faction player already HAS the visitor: log into a character of that player's faction on the same realm, travel to the Roost, match War Mode, invite that player so they join the shard, then relog to the character that needs credit and target /wave the visitor. This does not force the visitor to spawn or guarantee a compatible phase; confirm visibility and the actual criterion. No class-trial creation is required if you already have an eligible alt.",
        stepCount = 5,
        waypoints = {
            { mapID = 198, x = 0.271, y = 0.625, step = 1, label = "Sanctuary of Malorne - unlocks and daily quests" },
            { mapID = 198, x = 0.31, y = 0.86, step = 2, label = "Sethria's Roost terraces - visiting helper search area" },
        },
        sources = {
