    [5877] = {
        description = "An account-wide collection milestone. The reward is added to the Pet Journal, rather than requiring a visit to a reward NPC.",
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - No difficult fight is required, but collecting 125 different species takes travel and a growing collection.\n\n1. Open Menagerie in Pet Battles > Collect and check its unique-species counter. Learn unused pet items and cages already in your bags before spending more gold; duplicates do not close the gap to 125.\n\n2. Buy missing vendor species. For example, Breanni in Northrend Dalaran at 58.6,39.6 sells Obsidian Hatchling, Albino Snake and Calico Cat. Alliance can also visit Donni Anthania at 44.2,53.2 in Elwynn Forest for the cheap house-cat varieties. Learn only species your account is missing.\n\n3. Train Battle Pet Training if necessary and capture missing wild species. Begin with low-level pets in Elwynn Forest (Alliance) or Durotar (Horde), then visit additional zones rather than repeatedly catching the same species. Reduce a wild pet below the trap's health threshold, use Trap, and win the encounter.\n\n4. Continue with inexpensive missing cages and guaranteed quest pets until you reach 125. The game adds Brilliant Kaliri to your Pet Journal automatically. Clear journal filters and relog if the achievement has completed but the pet is not yet visible; do not wait for an old-style Breanni reward letter.",
